  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening IOM&apos;s Life-saving Multisectoral Assistance to Crisis Affected Popultations in Iran</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to support the Government of Iran with lifesaving assistance for Afghan nationals, including undocumented and new arrivals, and their host community. Activities included under this proposal are in line with IOM&#x2019;s Comprehensive Action Plan for Afghanistan and Neighbouring Countries, revised and published on February 2022, as well as the Refugee Response Plan led by UNHCR for 2022 to respond to humanitarian needs, whilst simultaneously mitigating the impact of the crisis in the region and supporting mid- and long-term support to affected persons, governments and societies for recovery and sustainable development.</narrative>
  </description>
